From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Richard Swanson <rswanson05@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 21:37:27 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] chore: update from inquisitive-me/herdr releases

herdr update, background version checks and remote installs read this
fork's latest.json, so the patched build is not replaced by upstream.
CI compiles the release tag in as HERDR_FORK_RELEASE and latest.json
carries it: a different release of the same upstream version counts as
an update, builds without a tag never chase one, and herdr --version
prints the release.

